Package: cybroid-camera
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: CybroidOS maintainers <citos@cybroid.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/cybroidinstitute/cit-os
Section: video
Priority: optional
Depends: cybroid-ui (= @VERSION@), libqt6core6t64 (>= 6.8), libqt6gui6 (>= 6.8), libqt6qml6 (>= 6.8), libqt6quick6 (>= 6.8),
 libqt6network6 (>= 6.8), libqt6multimedia6 (>= 6.8), qml6-module-qtmultimedia, libstdc++6, libc6, xdg-utils
Description: CybroidOS Camera
 Photos and videos from the computer's camera, in CybroidOS's own design:
 a timer, a mirrored preview, the other camera, and the last shot a tap
 away. Photos go to Pictures/Camera, videos to Videos/Camera.
